# Cleanup: delete each disposable active booking as its guest/host and cancelled
# booking as host before deleting the property; preserve historical fixtures.
# VG2 simultaneous API and direct DB writes: backend/scripts/verify-overlap-live.mjs.
# VG6 forged prices are discarded/overwritten, so the secure result is success at
# the trusted price. Direct tampering assertions are in verify-price-live.mjs.
### G1 logout - cookies cleared; subsequent /auth/me is 401
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/logout
Origin: {{frontendOrigin}}
Cookie: {{guestCookies}}
